OL,3,GNEWSAHopes study will force A1 dualling
OL,4,Areassessment
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth East political figures hope the
OL,7,Fgovernment will be forced to reassess
OL,8,Fdualling the A1, saying a new study had
OL,9,Fidentified additional economic
OL,10,Fbenefits.
OL,12,FThere have long been calls for the
OL,13,Fsingle carriageway stretch in
OL,14,FNorthumberland to be upgraded but it
OL,15,Fhas been reignited following the deaths
OL,16,Fof eight people this year.
OL,18,FNorthumberland County Council said it
OL,19,Fcommissioned research which suggested
OL,20,Fthe dualling scheme would deliver more
OL,21,Fthan #200m in benefits than previously
OL,22,Fanticipated.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
