OL,3,GNEWSAHopes study will force A1 dualling
OL,4,Areassessment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government scrapped a previous
OL,7,Fdualling scheme due to spiralling
OL,8,Fcosts, but the Department for Transport
OL,9,F(DfT) said it was "continuing to engage
OL,10,Fwith relevant stakeholders" on the
OL,11,Fissue.
